title: The Trial of Ozzy Carletzky
priority: 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true
view-if: month = 1 and year = 2300
on-arrival: {! if (typeof Q.syncIgAttitudes === 'function') { Q.syncIgAttitudes() } !}

The theatre critic turned citizen journalist Ozzy Carletzky has been charged with defamation for his accusations against Fairmarsh Trogwen, one of the city's most prominent and well connected Otherworld migrants.  Carletzky and Trogwen have been fighting in the courts for years over his demonstration that the cure-all product she is spokeswoman for is not only medically useless but carcinogenic.  As the case slowly winds its way through the courts however, suspicions have been raised that Goop may just be the tip of the iceberg and Trogwen is associated with a real estate firm profiting from ethnic cleansing.  Carletzky has friends among the democratic movement of Mikasa and some of them are suggesting helping him.

- @geopolitical
