We quietly ask our contacts at the cycler waystations to pull whatever they can on Trogwen's real estate partners.  Archivists on Hyacinth and elsewhere owe Mikasa favors, and ethnic-cleansing profiteering is the sort of scandal that's hard to cover up completely.

It will take months for documents to surface and be verified, but Carletzky's lawyers are told to stall.

