Our reformed investigative unit treats Carletzky's court filings as probable cause.  They start tracing shell companies tied to Trogwen's wellness brand and the property syndicate Carletzky keeps naming in whispers.

The work has to stay discrete — the judiciary is still largely corporate property — but a real paper trail is forming.

