The Families have a network of influence that stretches throughout the solar system and even into the otherworld.  They start putting the squeeze on various clerks and contractors.  Pretty soon they leak some ironclad evidence to the press.  We suspect the evidence might be fraudulent but sometimes a lie can sell a truth better then the truth can sell itself.

