When we reached out to the Bleeding Edges, we hoped that they might find digital secrets that would help us.  The evidence they provide us is far more surprising and disturbing.  The body of a racial extremist group member is delivered anonymously with the still living head of a displaced person attached to it.  The head shows evidence of years of torture.  The body shows evidence of far more recent torture, followed by the head attachment surgery.  This disturbing witness doesn't have long to live but it's plenty of time to generate extremely compelling courtroom testimony.

One of the leaders of the Edges sends us a note congratulating us on securing the evidence and suggests we do this again sometime.


