The Sharks are crude but effective.  They apply pressure where Trogwen's syndicate partners actually live, and suddenly several witnesses become much more cooperative about what they saw in the Otherworld territories.

@cant_help_wont_help
title: We lack the resources to help

We have to pick our battles, Carletzky will need to fight this on his own.  This trial will take years to respond, maybe by the time it finishes the situation will be different.